    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW28uMonv2STamXD5SQyPVzu4)_\n\n## What\nThe \"Open pull requests\" section of `CHANGELOG.org` held 78 entries, almost all for pull requests that have merged. Only #125, #171, #258 and #261 are open on GitHub.\n\n- **Being developed** replaces it: seven short items (SVG heading tags and #261, DEVONthink/litdb/litnotes, palette import #125, listening list #171, tangle check #258, sp-thesis-dump redesign, reading mode), each with what is done and what is untested.\n- **Finished entries** are now one line each in their feature set, in dependency order. New sets: DEVONthink/litdb and literature notes, Author and literature note lint, Org tables and dynamic blocks, Reading mode. Set date ranges updated.\n- **Verbose text** moved to the \"Changes by pull request\" section of the module doc each entry linked to (created where missing), with links re-based. Facts the docs lacked for #185, #186, #192, #240, #246 to #249 and #256 were added to their existing bullets.\n- Repeated variants of one entry are kept once (the newest): #193, #200, #207, #210 (four copies), #228. #184, #176 and #218 were already in their sets.\n- Fixed a wrong number: the Obsidian-style table entry was listed as #206, the pull request is #203.\n\n## Not done\n- Entries for #251, #253, #254, #255 and #257 were never in the changelog and are not added here.\n- No Emacs in the container, so the `tangle` check was not run. Only prose sections of the docs changed, no code blocks.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiDNgAiQzsbw1GXWSBo)_",
    "changed_files": 33,
    "closed_at": "2026-11-02T17:36:52Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "OWNER",
            "body": "The `tangle` check is red, but not because of this PR. It names only `libraries/modules/base/navi/sp-search.el`, which this PR does not touch. It is the Recoll menu entry that #258 re-tangles, so `tangle` is also red on `main`. This PR only edits prose sections of the docs. I did not port the #258 fix here, to keep this PR to the changelog. The check should go green once #258 merges and this branch picks it up.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
